The <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/2026/10/27/14-inch-macbook-pro-with-m6-chip/">just-announced</a> 14-inch MacBook Pro with M6 chip features memory bandwidth of up to 170GB/s, up from 153GB/s in the M5 model, but notably the performance increase doesn't stretch to the base 16GB configuration. <br/>
<br/>
