According to Apple's <a href="https://www.apple.com/macbook-pro/specs/">tech specs page</a>, the option for 16GB of unified memory remains limited to 153GB/s. That's identical to the M5 version, while only the new 24GB and 32GB configurations receive the faster 170GB/s memory bandwidth. <br/>
<br/>
